          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports running out of the blue puffer a few weeks ago and using the grey one when remembered; stopped antibiotics a day early because he felt all right; may have missed a couple of prednisolone doses; forgets tiotropium about half the time and often takes only a couple of budesonide/formoterol puffs when tight. Wife reports he forgets about half of his puffers unless reminded."
